Expose a port of the active LangSmith sandbox on the web and return a dashboard link that shows
the app full-size, with a chat with this thread beside it. Prefer this over `expose_port` when
sharing an app for a person to try or review, so they can ask you for changes while looking at it.
`app_url` in the result is the bare service URL `expose_port` would return; use it for API clients
and anything that is not a person in a browser.

